--- !u!114 &5787365650010350465
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4850955001607622312}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 25a98cb3857bdae43814b27182482d56, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SowurShield.Runtime::SowurShield.Dialogue.NPCDialogueInteractable
  npcId: maren
  npcDisplayName: Maren
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1299660ed2a86ba4dbb7ad60bf4683f7, type: 3}
  npcBioLocalized:
    m_TableReference:
      m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
    m_TableEntryReference:
      m_KeyId: 14950889696256002
      m_Key: 
    m_FallbackState: 0
    m_WaitForCompletion: 0
    m_LocalVariables: []
  npcBio: Maren arrived in the valley after losing three harvests in a row to a devastating
    drought. She lost everything she had planted in the eastern valley, but found
    something different in this land - a fertility that feels almost blessed. She
    sells seeds, but what she truly sells is hope.
  availableDialogues:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b5d761df7ae1491ca7f8aa9376dcd455, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e043caee31aa4359878ae76b174b29da, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e82b14551d94a80a155bc50a3332d87, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 27868e772d2a4b12b99366f7e0964dea, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 92f31bc57055445fbf30ccc39566cf22, type: 2}
  defaultDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b5d761df7ae1491ca7f8aa9376dcd455, type: 2}
  interactionPrompt: {fileID: 4333675948389773232}
  dialogueBox: {fileID: 0}
  interactionRange: 1.5
  allowRepeatedConversations: 1
  cooldownBetweenInteractions: 1
  disableMovementDuringDialogue: 1
  enableGifting: 1
  enableSeedShop: 1
  shopData: {fileID: 0}
  loreEntries:
  - requiredRelationship: 0
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450304
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: Who is Maren?
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450305
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: Maren is the valley's seed merchant. She wakes before sunrise just to feel
      the soil between her fingers - there is a magic in that first moment when a
      seed opens.
  - requiredRelationship: 10
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450306
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: The Valley
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450307
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: This valley has history. People come, plant, harvest and leave. Something
      here keeps you - the land, the rhythm of the seasons. They say a druid blessed
      the deepest layers of the soil.
  - requiredRelationship: 40
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450308
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: The Eastern Valley Drought
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450309
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: Maren lost three harvests in a row to a devastating drought in the eastern
      valley. She arrived with nothing, but found a land that welcomed her differently.
      Her mother used to say the seed that survives winter blooms stronger.
  - requiredRelationship: 75
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450310
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: Her Father's Seed
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889700450311
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: Maren carries a mysterious seed found in her father's coat pocket the day
      he died. She never knew what plant it was - she never had the courage to plant
      it, afraid of losing the last thing she has of him.
  lovedGifts:
  - MysterySeed
  - Pumpkin
  likedGifts:
  - Carrot
  - Tomato
  - Cabbage
  - Radish
  dislikedGifts:
  - Rabbit Fur
  - Feather
  dailyTalkAffinity: 1
  interactionSound: {fileID: 0}
  audioSource: {fileID: 0}
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
